    "detailed_description": "<h1>OTHER GAMES</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join us on Discord!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dive into 'Intergalactic Pawn Shop,' a captivating, story-rich pawn shop simulation game!</h2><br>Imagine being the key player in a bustling interstellar economy, where each customer brings a piece of the cosmos to your counter. <br><br>'Intergalactic Pawn Shop' melds the intricate management of a pawn shop\u2014encompassing repairs, auctions, and the creation of compelling displays\u2014with the significant decisions and ethical dilemmas of operating such an establishment in a futuristic setting. Will you emerge as a beacon of prosperity in the galaxy, or will your choices propel you into a web of intrigue and shadowy transactions?<br><br>Envision yourself negotiating with an alien over a mysterious artifact, then meticulously repairing a damaged starship component. 'Intergalactic Pawn Shop' fuses the day-to-day mechanics of pawn shop operations with the expansive narrative arcs of a sci-fi saga.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.poster.avif?t=1727515597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.webm?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.mp4?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game invites players to step into the role of a pawn shop clerk in a science fiction universe, blending detailed simulation with a branching narrative that culminates in multiple endings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.poster.avif?t=1727515597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.webm?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.mp4?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>- Immerse yourself in a detailed pawn shop simulation, overseeing repairs, auctions, and the display area to attract a diverse clientele.<br>- Embark on a non-linear adventure with choices that dictate your path, leading to unique endings and determining not only the destiny of your shop but the wider universe as well.<br><br>A powerful trading network is at your disposal, positioning you as a magnet for those in search of your services. The question remains: How will you wield this influence?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join us on Discord!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dive into 'Intergalactic Pawn Shop,' a captivating, story-rich pawn shop simulation game!</h2><br>Imagine being the key player in a bustling interstellar economy, where each customer brings a piece of the cosmos to your counter. <br><br>'Intergalactic Pawn Shop' melds the intricate management of a pawn shop\u2014encompassing repairs, auctions, and the creation of compelling displays\u2014with the significant decisions and ethical dilemmas of operating such an establishment in a futuristic setting. Will you emerge as a beacon of prosperity in the galaxy, or will your choices propel you into a web of intrigue and shadowy transactions?<br><br>Envision yourself negotiating with an alien over a mysterious artifact, then meticulously repairing a damaged starship component. 'Intergalactic Pawn Shop' fuses the day-to-day mechanics of pawn shop operations with the expansive narrative arcs of a sci-fi saga.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.poster.avif?t=1727515597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.webm?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/f88e47ea040d5d9f8972ac7a5ffcc0bf.mp4?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game invites players to step into the role of a pawn shop clerk in a science fiction universe, blending detailed simulation with a branching narrative that culminates in multiple endings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.poster.avif?t=1727515597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.webm?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407760/extras/5c8e3f3b36438a2de574f1bdd067657d.mp4?t=1727515597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>- Immerse yourself in a detailed pawn shop simulation, overseeing repairs, auctions, and the display area to attract a diverse clientele.<br>- Embark on a non-linear adventure with choices that dictate your path, leading to unique endings and determining not only the destiny of your shop but the wider universe as well.<br><br>A powerful trading network is at your disposal, positioning you as a magnet for those in search of your services. The question remains: How will you wield this influence?",
    "short_description": "Intergalactic Pawn Shop is a single-player, story rich, pawn shop simulation game. In your hands lies a powerful trading network, making you a magnet for those seeking your services. Will you use this influence wisely? Remember, the outcomes of your decisions will rest solely on your shoulders.",
